  "id": "psychosocial-support",
  "term": "psychosocial support",
  "definition": "Psychosocial support is help intended to improve emotional and social wellbeing, such as reducing loneliness and negative feelings and strengthening a sense of belonging. In this context, it refers to culturally acceptable school-based support that does not rely only on students openly identifying themselves as needing help.",
